"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここは山田クンの部屋だ.
#. 今は, 特に dụng là ないかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is Hifumi's room. I don't really have anything to\n"
